WEBVTT

00:06:58.539 --> 00:07:01.041
For example,

00:07:01.083 --> 00:07:04.962
I spent a couple of years
serving on a condo board

00:07:05.004 --> 00:07:07.756
until I finally got tired
of being yelled at.

00:07:07.756 --> 00:07:09.300
(Laughter)

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:16.390
You see, one year the board decided
that we were going to plant daffodils

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:18.934
rather than the traditional daisies,

00:07:18.934 --> 00:07:20.853
(Laughter)

00:07:20.895 --> 00:07:22.563
and we got yelled at.

00:07:23.314 --> 00:07:24.857
Go figure.

00:07:25.566 --> 00:07:27.359
I thought about law school,

00:07:27.401 --> 00:07:30.029
thinking perhaps of becoming a paralegal.